<title>USA: Bridgeport sees Q3, Q4 sales below Q1.</title>
<headline>Bridgeport sees Q3, Q4 sales below Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgeport Machines Inc said Thursday that it expects sales for the third and fourth quarters of FY 1997 to be below the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said profit margins will likely be hurt by pricing pressures in Europe and the price promotion on manual mills.</p>
<p>The company said it expects net income for full fiscal 1997 will more or less match that of fiscal 1996.</p>
</text>
